{
  "label": "Portainer",
  "authType": "api_key",
  "category": "cloud",
  "description": "Docker environments: containers, stacks, logs",
  "glyph": "M4 16h16M6 16V9h12v7M9 9V6h6v3M12 16v4",
  "color": "#13bef9",
  "needsBaseUrl": true,
  "secretPlacement": "header",
  "apiKeyHeader": "X-API-Key",
  "testPath": "/api/endpoints",
  "sensitivePaths": [
    {
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/endpoints/*/docker/containers/*/stop",
      "action": "confirm",
      "label": "Stop a container"
    },
    {
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/endpoints/*/docker/containers/*/kill",
      "action": "confirm",
      "label": "Stop a container"
    },
    {
      "method": "DELETE",
      "path": "*",
      "action": "confirm",
      "label": "Delete (container, stack, image…)"
    }
  ],
  "agentGuide": "Environments first: GET /api/endpoints (Id, Name, Type, Status). Then the Docker API of one, proxied: GET /api/endpoints/<id>/docker/containers/json?all=true (Names, Image, State, Status), GET /api/endpoints/<id>/docker/containers/<id>/json, logs: GET /api/endpoints/<id>/docker/containers/<id>/logs?stdout=true&stderr=true&tail=100, stats: /stats?stream=false; images: GET /api/endpoints/<id>/docker/images/json; start/stop/restart: POST /api/endpoints/<id>/docker/containers/<id>/start (stop, restart). Stacks: GET /api/stacks, one: GET /api/stacks/<id>, its file: GET /api/stacks/<id>/file; stop/start: POST /api/stacks/<id>/stop (start). System: GET /api/system/status, /api/system/version. Logs may be long: ask for a tail. The key is set by Allkin.",
